                                "sense_id": "22fac057-c2bd-3dcf-919d-f79a19b808c5",
                                "text": "In 2007 was de winterzonnestilstand op 22 december, dat was de kortste dag van het jaar."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab7f864b-df5a-4cce-8265-0c7e011cfed6",
